  "2026-10-11T05:16:37.593Z",codex-sol,"Acceptance met on main 7c0f0e0: index.ts:1393 exposes proposition/holds/expected/ok and compares full precision before presentation rounding. Test: gate expectations distinguish unsafe secrets, clean text and inclusive boundaries (test/agent-ux.test.ts:19), including expect=false, p==threshold, invalid flags and absence of ambiguous passed. Fresh main acceptance: node --test test/agent-ux.test.ts test/decisions.test.ts test/transport.test.ts test/release-workflow.test.ts test/calibration.test.ts passed 51/51, zero failures/skips. Tracker schema has no review status, so status stays in_progress; not closed. Cross-reference docs/tracker-reconciliation.md; line numbers refer to checked main."
